{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00384","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 五 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝坛雾卷，曙岭烟沈。\n爰设筐币，式表诚心。\n筵辉丽璧，乐畅和音。\n仰惟灵鉴，俯察翘襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}